# secrets/manifest — plaintext registry of every secret in this repo.
#
# This is the SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for which secrets exist, which services
# consume them, and whether a placeholder value is currently acceptable.
# Actual values live ONLY in the per-secret .age files next to this file,
# each encrypted to (2) recipients: the operator and the LXC host.
#
# Format: TAB-separated columns, one secret per line.
#   name<TAB>consumers<TAB>required<TAB>placeholder<TAB>purpose
#   name        env var name (also the .age filename, minus suffix)
#   consumers   comma-separated list of env-file consumers that need it:
#                 hermes    -> $HERMES_HOME/.env (hermes-agent + dashboard +
#                              ha profile + opencode CLI children)
#                 hindsight -> Hindsight container (podman)
#                 nicegui   -> hermes-nicegui web UI unit
#                 xaelwiki  -> xaelwiki MCP server unit
#   required    1 = deploy gate FAILS if missing; 0 = warn only
#   placeholder literal value that, if present, FAILS deploy (e.g. CHANGE-ME);
#              empty = a real value is mandatory (any non-placeholder content ok)
#   purpose    human description (spaces allowed)
#
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored. Keep sorted by name. The Nix module
# (modules/hermes-secrets.nix) parses this file at eval time and generates
# age.secrets.* + per-consumer env aggregation; scripts/hermes-secrets runs
# the same checks at edit/deploy/doctor time.

LLM_API_KEY	hermes	1		gateway model.api_key (vLLM local / openrouter); shared with opencode-go
HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_API_KEY	hindsight	1		Hindsight extraction/retrieval LLM key (same value as LLM_API_KEY)
HINDSIGHT_API_KEY	hindsight,hermes	1		hermes memory provider -> Hindsight data plane (must equal tenant key)
HINDSIGHT_API_TENANT_API_KEY	hindsight	1		Hindsight data-plane bearer token (all clients)
HINDSIGHT_CP_ACCESS_KEY	hindsight	1		Hindsight control-plane login (web UI password)
HINDSIGHT_CP_DATAPLANE_API_KEY	hindsight	1		must equally HINDSIGHT_API_TENANT_API_KEY
HINDSIGHT_API_TOKEN	hermes	1		opencode hindsight plugin auth (== tenant key)
OPENCODE_API_KEY	hermes	1		opencode-go API key (same value as LLM_API_KEY)
OPENCODE_GO_API_KEY	hermes	1		opencode-go service key
OPENROUTER_API_KEY	hermes	1		OpenRouter fallback provider key
TAVILY_API_KEY	hermes	1		Tavily web-search API key
AGENTMAIL_API_KEY	hermes	1		AgentMail MCP inbox key (resolved via ${env:...})
TAILSCALE_CLIENT_ID	hermes	1		Tailscale OAuth client id
TAILSCALE_CLIENT_SECRET	hermes	1		Tailscale OAuth client secret
DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN	hermes	1		Discord platform bot token
DISCORD_ALLOWED_USERS	hermes	1		comma-separated Discord user ids allowed
DISCORD_HOME_CHANNEL	hermes	1		Discord home channel URL
HASS_URL	hermes	1		Home Assistant instance URL (ha profile)
HASS_TOKEN	hermes	1		Home Assistant long-lived access token (ha profile)
API_SERVER_KEY	hermes	1		gateway multiplexed api_server listener key
HERMES_DASHBOARD_BASIC_AUTH_USERNAME	hermes	1		dashboard basic-auth username
HERMES_DASHBOARD_BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD_HASH	hermes	1		dashboard basic-auth scrypt password hash
HERMES_DASHBOARD_BASIC_AUTH_SECRET	hermes	1		dashboard session-signing secret (32+ b64)
XAEL_AUTH_TOKEN	hermes,xaelwiki	1		xaelwiki MCP server bearer token
GITHUB_PAT	hermes	1		GitHub PAT for git operations and future API access
HERMES_KANBAN_USERNAME	nicegui	1		nicegui kanban plugin -> dashboard cookie login
HERMES_KANBAN_PASSWORD	nicegui	1	CHANGE-ME	nicegui kanban plaintext password (== dashboard password)
HERMES_API_TOKEN	nicegui	1		nicegui -> gateway api_server bearer (must equal API_SERVER_KEY)
